            "detailed_description": "The great Zeno war will end soon...... that's right, the series is finally reaching it's conclusion.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nZenodeath is the final entry in the Zeno series (Zenodyne, Zenohell, Zenodyne R) and it definitely is going out with a bang.<br />\r\nEverything we made so far, has built up to this game..... here are some features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 9 Stages!<br />\r\n- 3 Different mechas completely different from each other.<br />\r\n- Said stages are divided evenly between Air and Ground modes.<br />\r\n- Ground mode is the new gameplay type that plays like old arcade run and guns.<br />\r\n- A modern soundtrack by HeavyViper who previously did FM music in our previous games<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSee you in September 2020, when this game comes out, until then, feel free to wishlist it.",
